 Help                                                                           
 Keys act on the selected row; in a prompt, tab completes and esc cancels       
   n / space  next turn                                                         
   p          previous turn (restores durations, not other edits)               
   ↑↓ / j k   move the selection                                                
   g / G      first / last row                                                  
   /          jump to a row by name                                             
   a          add a combatant, or a group: Goblin x4                            
   x          remove the combatant / end the effect early                       
   d / h      damage / heal (=N sets HP)                                        
   t          temp HP (N replaces, +N adds)                                     
   D          nonlethal damage (=N sets the total; rulesets that track it)      
   M          edit max HP                                                       
   P          edit counters / resources (e.g. LA 3/3 reset)                     
   c / C      add / remove a condition                                          
   e          new effect (source: the selected combatant)                       
   T          change an effect's targets                                        
   i / I      edit initiative / quick pass over all combatants                  
   N / R      edit the side note / rename row                                   
   l          write a log entry                                                 
   A          add or cancel a round countdown timer                             
   u / U      undo / redo the last change (ctrl+r also redoes)                  
   r          roll dice, e.g. 2d6+2+1d4; enter alone rolls the last again       
 ↑↓/jk scroll · lines 1–22 of 78 · any other key closes                         